##########################################
Download and filter data
##########################################

The download and filtering process of the PyPSA-Earth energy system model consists of a group of ``snakemake`` rules which are briefly outlined and explained in detail in the sections below.

Not all data dependencies are shipped with the git repository. Instead we provide separate data bundles which are loaded automatically when running the `solve_all_networks` rule when the `retrieve_databundle_light` flag in the configuration file is on.

