**ERA5 cutout:**

    ===================  ==========  ==========  =========================================================
    Field                Dimensions  Unit        Description
    ===================  ==========  ==========  =========================================================
    pressure             time, y, x  Pa          Surface pressure
    -------------------  ----------  ----------  ---------------------------------------------------------
    temperature          time, y, x  K           Air temperature 2 meters above the surface.
    -------------------  ----------  ----------  ---------------------------------------------------------
